					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">How to Install a Ceiling Fan: A Beginner&#8217;s Guide</h1>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-4ec2fc4 elementor-widget elementor-widget-post-info" data-id="4ec2fc4" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="post-info.default">
